From: rgslide-linux <mainline@rgslide>
Subject: [PATCH] pwm/backlight: add Unisoc UMS9620 (qogirn6pro) PWM and backlight compatibles

The RG Slide stock DT declares the SoC PWM controller as "sprd,qogirn6pro-pwm"
(identical register layout and clock bindings to "sprd,ums512-pwm") and the
panel backlight as "sprd,qogirn6pro-backlight" (using standard pwm-backlight
properties: pwms, brightness-levels, default-brightness-level).

--- a/drivers/pwm/pwm-sprd.c
+++ b/drivers/pwm/pwm-sprd.c
@@ -278,6 +278,7 @@
 
 static const struct of_device_id sprd_pwm_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "sprd,ums512-pwm", },
+	{ .compatible = "sprd,qogirn6pro-pwm", },
 	{ },
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, sprd_pwm_of_match);
--- a/drivers/video/backlight/pwm_bl.c
+++ b/drivers/video/backlight/pwm_bl.c
@@ -349,6 +349,7 @@
 
 static const struct of_device_id pwm_backlight_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "pwm-backlight" },
+	{ .compatible = "sprd,qogirn6pro-backlight" },
 	{ }
 };
 
